  // ---------- personality — full ----------
  const LAGNA_BODY = [null, "Medium height, an agile body, sharp eyes and a confident face; quick in walking and talking.", "A strong, well-built body, attractive eyes and a lovely smile; a calm, steady gait.", "An agile body, lively eyes and a habit of talking with gestures; you look younger than your age.", "A soft face, expressive eyes, medium height; warmth shows on your face.", "Broad shoulders, an impressive walk and a confident face; a personality that stands out in a crowd.", "A well-formed, neat personality and intelligent eyes; refined in dress and grooming.", "A balanced, graceful build and a charming smile; good taste in clothes.", "Deep, powerful eyes and a strong body; seriousness and a touch of mystery on your face.", "An energetic body, an open face and a cheerful smile; confidence in your walk.", "A strong-boned body and a serious face; your personality shines more with age.", "Tall or distinctive in style, with a friendly face; freshness in thinking and dress.", "A soft, full face and dreamy eyes; gentle and warm in manner."];
