    const decide = X.strength("Mercury") >= 1.8 && X.strength("Jupiter") >= 1.8 ? "You decide with both logic and understanding; so your decisions usually prove right." : (X.strength("Mercury") >= X.strength("Jupiter") ? "You decide by facts, numbers and logic. You find options quickly, but sometimes miss the big picture — take an experienced person’s opinion on big decisions." : "You decide by experience, intuition and ethics. Your gut feeling is often right, but in money and contracts move ahead only with the numbers written down.");
